{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32168","headline":"猎骑辞 · 温庭筠","name":"猎骑辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"早辞平扆殿，夕奉湘南宴。\n香兔抱微烟，重鳞叠轻扇。\n蚕饥使君马，雁避将军箭。\n宝柱惜离弦，流黄悲赤县。\n理钗低舞鬓，换袖回歌面。\n晚柳未如丝，春花已如霰。\n所嗟故里曲，不及青楼宴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32168.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32168","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}